{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/extras/3d4c4a95e7888b0f0904ae4438092e4d.avif?t=1755197454\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Information</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Greetings, and welcome to the mansion.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/extras/14b126746ca51c7d8732c569e6d189f4.poster.avif?t=1755197454\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/extras/14b126746ca51c7d8732c569e6d189f4.webm?t=1755197454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/extras/14b126746ca51c7d8732c569e6d189f4.mp4?t=1755197454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Nest</strong> is a first-person psychological horror adventure game that blends a walking simulator and point-and-click mechanics, all within a dark and psychological atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist ventures into a secluded mansion to find Sofia's manuscript. You will need to carefully examine this mansion and discover hidden clues to progress the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/extras/9945c4569be2af18cc38979fed9ccd31.avif?t=1755197454\" width=1600 height=127 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a dark night, Elizabeth visits a dusty old mansion to search for an old manuscript by the writer Sofia. The records within the mansion begin to slowly shake her memories...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/extras/6ab4c444b7b8d91344dcfc690912929c.poster.avif?t=1755197454\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/extras/6ab4c444b7b8d91344dcfc690912929c.webm?t=1755197454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/extras/6ab4c444b7b8d91344dcfc690912929c.mp4?t=1755197454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/extras/cf7b2239669ca171b5e12b9fcc2e7ac0.avif?t=1755197454\" width=1600 height=127 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An entity within the mansion delves into Elizabeth's lost memories, revealing a truth she had wanted to hide.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/extras/e049400dd2de65ea30e1c670ac71b847.poster.avif?t=1755197454\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/extras/e049400dd2de65ea30e1c670ac71b847.webm?t=1755197454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/extras/e049400dd2de65ea30e1c670ac71b847.mp4?t=1755197454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/extras/501f302d86722df78712e60f5547633e.avif?t=1755197454\" width=1600 height=127 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through various interactions in the mansion, you must recover Elizabeth's memories and uncover the truth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/extras/2e6622552446c68a7682b18c3c73159e.poster.avif?t=1755197454\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/extras/2e6622552446c68a7682b18c3c73159e.webm?t=1755197454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/extras/2e6622552446c68a7682b18c3c73159e.mp4?t=1755197454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark and Atmospheric Environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed and Realistic Soundscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather Clues Through Varied Interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The estimated playtime for the game is about <strong>one hour</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>hints.txt</strong> file is included in the game's installation folder</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bird lover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3751330/737b9632c5f428536dcf895f7b4964229926da77.jpg"},{"name":"Listener of Ti